    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare the joint observed patterns of genus size, infraspecific variation, relatedness and range size under explicit branching-descent models versus independent-origin models. Strong likelihood or predictive advantage for descent supports the inference.";
